<span data-as=3D"p">Studio makes each step of your agent easily observable.=
 Replay any input and inspect the exact prompt, tool arguments, return valu=
es, and token/latency metrics. If a tool throws an exception, Studio record=
s it with surrounding state so you can spend less time debugging.</span>
<span data-as=3D"p">Keep your dev server running, edit prompts or tool sign=
atures, and watch Studio hot-reload. Re-run the conversation thread from an=
y step to verify behavior changes. See <a class=3D"link" href=3D"https://do=
cs.langchain.com/langsmith/use-studio#edit-thread-history">Manage threads</=
a> for more details.</span>
<span data-as=3D"p">As your agent grows, the same view scales from a single=
-tool demo to multi-node graphs, keeping decisions legible and reproducible=
.</span>
